  2. Restore C-s/C-r to isearch; move consult-line to M-s l and its repeat
     to M-s L.
Decision: option 1 — keep the split, document it.
Change per decision; keep the isearch settings in dk-defaults.el
consistent with whichever keys reach isearch.
Verify: key-binding of C-s, C-r, (M-s l) match; cheatsheet updated.
Commit: "Document search key split" / "Restore isearch on C-s"
Result: src/dk-defaults.el (Search comment), src/dk-completion.el (C-s comment), cheatsheet.md.
C-s = consult-line, C-r = isearch-backward.


